cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "BP-TD: Dependence-Aware Belief Propagation for Unsupervised Truth Discovery among AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  Code and cached data for BP-TD, a dependence-aware variational message-passing
  method for unsupervised truth discovery over pools of heterogeneous LLM agents.
  BP-TD runs mean-field variational message passing on a one-coin Dawid-Skene model
  over the agent-question-value graph, with a per-agent decorrelation weight that
  discounts agents sharing a base model or an empirical agreement cluster.
